    "preamble": "Kuntigurla Durga Rao vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 30 November, 2022 Author: R. Raghunandan Rao Bench: R. Raghunandan Rao Hon'Ble Sri Justice R. Raghunandan Rao Criminal Petition No.9487 of 2022 Order:",
